{"4248740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farmer Cats", "steam_appid": 4248740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Newlywed Cats save Grandpa Cat's farm! Direct cute cats to complete a variety of tasks in this relaxing casual simulation game. These cool cats can grow crops, build structures, and decorate the farm. But as their overseer, make sure they also take breaks and eat. Whether they are working or relaxing, they will live on your screen while you also work or relax on your PC. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click on the Cats to instruct them of their tasks as they work at the bottom of your PC screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and sell different types of crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures and decorate the farm.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Newlywed Cats save Grandpa Cat's farm! Direct cute cats to complete a variety of tasks in this relaxing casual simulation game. These cool cats can grow crops, build structures, and decorate the farm. But as their overseer, make sure they also take breaks and eat. Whether they are working or relaxing, they will live on your screen while you also work or relax on your PC. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click on the Cats to instruct them of their tasks as they work at the bottom of your PC screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and sell different types of crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures and decorate the farm.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Farmer Cats is a relaxing casual simulation game featuring cute cats that can farm, fish, and build.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4248740/ee45a5e475bfd12ce5bc02528d82e571ac526ab9/header.jpg?t=1773324213", "capsule_